  "question": "Combine the pre-task requirement state with the current client task. If the task determines a unique post-task state, choose ACT and construct that state; otherwise choose CLARIFY and identify the blocking requirement field and the question that must be answered.",
  "target_task": {
    "source_message_id": 15,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Darius,\n\nFor the last round, I’ve provided the final chapter set along with the updated image tracker. There are no additional photo assets available for this round, so the work should concentrate on the manuscript, image placeholders, and tracker.\n\nWhenever a visual is still required, please identify the type of image or graphic that would be most suitable and include any recommendations that could strengthen the visual plan.\n\nBefore the manuscript enters its next production phase, this round should ensure that all remaining chapters have a clear and usable image strategy.\n\nThank you!\nMarisol"
  },
  "history_pool": {
    "boundary": "STRICTLY_BEFORE_TARGET_MESSAGE",
    "contains_target_message": false,
    "message_count": 14,
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hello, Marisol.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thanks for the quick response; I really appreciate it.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Yes, that arrangement works for me.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Darius—\n\nFour representative chapters and the current (lean) image tracker are included here for your preliminary review; I look forward to your thoughts.\n\nThanks,\nMarisol",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marisol, my recommendations are ready in the attached doc after reviewing Chapter 17 together with your image tracker. I’ve addressed which visuals should be repositioned, removed, or replaced, including a licensing concern you should know about. The document also identifies where new visuals would add the most authority and includes a note about captions.\n\nIf you decide to move forward, I’m happy either to discuss any part of the recommendations or to begin work on the full manuscript immediately.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Darius,\n\nFor the visual strategy pass, I’d like to proceed at $1,275 total. To keep the process clean, the fee will be divided into three equal, chapter-based milestones of $425 each.\n\nFor every milestone, I’ll provide the relevant chapter files, image tracker, and any visuals that are available.\n\nEach milestone should include these deliverables:\n\n1. Visual placeholders inserted into the manuscript chapters\n2. An updated image tracker covering those chapters\n3. A high-level explanation of the placement strategy for every chapter, including the reasoning behind which visuals should be kept, cut, moved, added, sourced, or created\n\nThe strategy should establish which visuals belong, which ones should be removed, where each visual should appear, what must be sourced, what requires permission, and what should be created later.\n\nPlease limit the work to visual strategy and placement. Final design, formatting, image sourcing, and graphic creation are not included.\n\nThe assigned rounds are:\n\nMilestone 4 — $425\nChapters 11–14\n\nMilestone 5 — $425\nChapters 15–18\n\nMilestone 6 — $425\nChapters 19–23\n\nBefore work begins, please confirm that this structure works for you.\n\nThanks,\nMarisol",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "My answer is yes: I accept the proposed milestone arrangement.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marisol, I’m happy to work within the agreed terms, and the three-milestone structure works for me.\n\nOnce you send the Chapter 11 to 14 files, image tracker, and any available visuals, I’ll be able to begin Milestone 4.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Marisol, could you send me the files for Chapters 11-14? I can’t get started until I receive them.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Darius,\n\nThe materials for Milestone 4 are attached. They include:\n\nImages assigned to those chapters 11-14\nChapters 11–14\nImage tracker 11-14\n\nThanks,\nMarisol",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The deliverables are ready; please review and approve them.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Darius,\n\nSince Milestone 4 has been reviewed and looks good, I’m moving ahead with Milestone 5.\n\nFor Chapters 15–18, I’ve attached the chapter files, image tracker, assigned images, and any unassigned possible photos that may be useful for review.\n\nThanks,\nMarisol",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Received—thank you, Marisol.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The second milestone submission is ready for your review and approval.",
        "milestone": null
      }
    ]
  },
